stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UNASSIGNED
    UNASSIGNED --> ENTRY_CANDIDATE: authoritative slot S
    ENTRY_CANDIDATE --> OCCUPIED: S stable 3 frames and 600 ms / VehicleEntered
    ENTRY_CANDIDATE --> UNASSIGNED: invalid, ambiguous or unstable
    OCCUPIED --> OCCUPIED: same slot / update last-seen
    OCCUPIED --> RELOCATION_CANDIDATE: different slot T
    RELOCATION_CANDIDATE --> OCCUPIED: unstable or old slot not vacated
    RELOCATION_CANDIDATE --> OCCUPIED: T stable 5 frames and 1 s / VehicleRelocated
    OCCUPIED --> EXIT_CANDIDATE: no slot or track missing
    EXIT_CANDIDATE --> OCCUPIED: identity returns to same slot
    EXIT_CANDIDATE --> UNASSIGNED: tracker TTL plus 5 s / VehicleExited

